<section class="sec lp-more">
  <div class="wrap lp-more-in" data-up>
    <p>Fees is one part of the SmartSchoolWala school ERP. Start with fees and add the rest when you are ready.</p>
    <a href="/school-attendance-management-software" class="btn btn-dark">Attendance management<i class="bx bx-right-arrow-alt"></i></a>
    <a href="/#modules" class="btn btn-dark">All features<i class="bx bx-right-arrow-alt"></i></a>
  </div>
</section>
